      "context": "SQL Console > Interaction",
      "contextHash": "33f1894f4094dfa6c4ece4c9e6048e352df63be1f42231b886b39301e04da037",
      "status": "translated",
      "active": true,
      "translation": "ステートメントを実行するには、__TRILIUM_PH_0__Execute__TRILIUM_PH_1__ アイコンを押します。",
      "conditions": {
        "model": "gemini-3.5-flash-lite",
        "promptHash": "716065651310a44dc7b240e50ada9f3b18164cb6a2471ec2ca8dd86023f06415",
        "glossaryHash": "87275a9e032d2599a1276554b41c0fed0509e3ed6ee1594f83705051d453ee50"
      },
      "translatedAt": "2026-11-14T14:14:05.465Z"
    },
    {
      "id": "u_2cb782a1bcbfcdd0594ffe09_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "For queries that return a result, the data will displayed in a table.",
      "sourceHash": "2cb782a1bcbfcdd0594ffe09f6d18d609785739b94b72326f161f6fdffa31f52",
      "context": "SQL Console > Interaction",
      "contextHash": "33f1894f4094dfa6c4ece4c9e6048e352df63be1f42231b886b39301e04da037",
      "status": "translated",
      "active": true,
      "translation": "結果を返すクエリの場合、データは表形式で表示されます。",
      "conditions": {
        "model": "gemini-3.5-flash-lite",
        "promptHash": "716065651310a44dc7b240e50ada9f3b18164cb6a2471ec2ca8dd86023f06415",
        "glossaryHash": "87275a9e032d2599a1276554b41c0fed0509e3ed6ee1594f83705051d453ee50"
      },
      "translatedAt": "2026-11-14T14:14:05.465Z"
    },
    {
      "id": "u_7c92db802808f22eb9a97767_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "For statements (e.g. __TRILIUM_PH_0__, __TRILIUM_PH_1__), the number of affected rows is displayed.",
      "sourceHash": "7c92db802808f22eb9a977670c79815b55dea63655378596c74a902bd6ac1048",
      "context": "SQL Console > Interaction",
      "contextHash": "33f1894f4094dfa6c4ece4c9e6048e352df63be1f42231b886b39301e04da037",
      "status": "translated",
      "active": true,
      "translation": "ステートメント（例：__TRILIUM_PH_0__、__TRILIUM_PH_1__）の場合、影響を受けた行数が表示されます。",
      "conditions": {
        "model": "gemini-3.5-flash-lite",
        "promptHash": "716065651310a44dc7b240e50ada9f3b18164cb6a2471ec2ca8dd86023f06415",
